XRechnung
=========

The artifact redistributes, unmodified, the official XRechnung validator
configuration published by KoSIT (Koordinierungsstelle fuer IT-Standards):

  validator-configuration-xrechnung
  https://github.com/itplr-kosit/validator-configuration-xrechnung
  File: io/github/nalukit/paniolo/rules/xrechnung/<release>.zip
  (exact version and SHA-256 in xrechnung-rules.properties next to it)

  Older XRechnung versions, also unmodified KoSIT releases:
  validator-configuration-xrechnung_1.2.2_2019-12-30.zip,
